# The §22B-1e2b failing-first run, kept rather than described.
#
# $ scripts/run_graph_measurement.sh --expect-full-contract --runs 1 --mode graph
#
# The contract is the whole of §22B-1e2b's brief, asserted against a real
# import of every measured graph: real serialized references survive, the
# visible names stay the designations, one shared Mesh per definition, no
# dependence on ordinal or collision counter, two sources with one local key
# stay two things, a removed object goes missing rather than being
# re-pointed, and no graph costs an object a person can see. It is meant to
# fail, and every clause it fails on is collected rather than stopping at
# the first.
#
# Temporary project paths are replaced with <project> and trailing spaces are
# stripped from the stack frames; nothing else is edited.

